---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'; import {data} from '../data/provider'; const interactions=data.all();
---
<Layout title="MimicryDB"><section class="bg-ink py-20 text-white"><div class="container"><span class="pill">DEMO / PROTOTYPE DATA</span><h1 class="mt-5 text-5xl font-bold">Who mimics whom<br/>across the Tree of Life?</h1><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg text-slate-200">An open database of documented mimic–model interactions across animals, plants, fungi, and other lineages.</p><a class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-lg bg-coral px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white" href="/MimicryDB/interactions/">Explore interactions →</a></div></section><section class="container py-14"><div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="card"><div class="text-3xl font-bold">{interactions.length}</div><div>sample interactions</div></div><div class="card"><div class="text-3xl font-bold">{new Set(interactions.map(x=>x.mimic)).size}</div><div>mimic taxa</div></div><a class="card block text-ink hover:border-teal" href="/MimicryDB/evidence/"><div class="text-3xl font-bold">E0–E4</div><div>evidence framework →</div></a></div><h2 class="mt-14 text-3xl font-bold">Mimic → Model</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl">The fundamental record is a directional biological interaction, linked to references and evidence provenance. Publication, interaction, taxon pair, and evolutionary origin remain distinct.</p></section></Layout>
